            {
              "content": "=You are a professional business proposal writer.\n\nCreate a professional project proposal based on the following customer information.\n\nCustomer Name:\n{{$json[\"customerName\"]}}\n\nBusiness:\n{{$json[\"business\"]}}\n\nBudget:\n{{$json[\"budget\"]}}\n\nProject Requirements:\n{{$json[\"projectRequirment\"]}}\n\nWrite the proposal using the following format:\n\n# Project Proposal\n\nDear {{$json[\"customerName\"]}},\n\nThank you for your interest in our services.\n\n## Project Overview\nBriefly explain the customer's project in a professional way.\n\n## Proposed Solution\nExplain how we will solve the customer's problem.\n\n## Estimated Timeline\nProvide an estimated timeline based on the project requirements.\n\n## Estimated Budget\nMention that the estimated budget is approximately {{$json[\"budget\"]}} and the final quotation will be confirmed after a detailed discussion.\n\n## Deliverables\nList 5 deliverables related to the project.\n\n## Next Steps\nInvite the customer to schedule a meeting to discuss the project.\n\nEnd the proposal with:\n\nBest Regards,\nAI Automation Team\n\nReturn only the proposal without any extra explanations."
            }
